WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.776 --> 00:00:15.607
Dr. Odd's robot charged toward Roxy.

2
00:00:16.487 --> 00:00:17.488
She jumped out of the way.

3
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.451
The robot poked a bubble floating nearby.

4
00:00:22.172 --> 00:00:23.953
Pop! A car fell out.

5
00:00:24.814 --> 00:00:28.797
"Aah!" the driver cried as the car fell toward the street.

6
00:00:28.817 --> 00:00:31.199
"Ha-ha!" Dr.

7
00:00:31.259 --> 00:00:31.800
Odd laughed.

8
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.781
Zoom! Roxy shot toward the car and caught it.

9
00:00:37.781 --> 00:00:39.622
Then—pop, pop, pop!

10
00:00:39.642 --> 00:00:43.123
"Help! Rocket Girl!"

11
00:00:43.283 --> 00:00:44.403
shouted several voices.

12
00:00:45.884 --> 00:00:46.644
Roxy looked up.

13
00:00:47.544 --> 00:00:50.565
The robot was popping more bubbles, and more cars were falling.

14
00:00:51.805 --> 00:00:54.866
"Now you'll be too busy to stop me!"

15
00:00:54.946 --> 00:00:55.927
Dr. Odd laughed.

16
00:00:56.867 --> 00:01:00.508
Roxy flew fast, catching each car before it hit the street.

17
00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:05.021
Soon all the cars were safe on the ground.

18
00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:08.503
They were all covered with blue sticky goo from the bubbles.

19
00:01:09.964 --> 00:01:12.485
Meanwhile the robot aimed its arm at Metro City Bank.

20
00:01:13.526 --> 00:01:15.347
Roxy flew fast and yanked its arm.

21
00:01:17.548 --> 00:01:20.570
She pointed it at the sky just as it sprayed more mist.

22
00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:23.732
"You won't stop me, Rocket Girl!"

23
00:01:23.972 --> 00:01:24.952
Dr. Odd shouted.

24
00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:27.194
Roxy flew down as Dr.

25
00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:28.314
Odd continued to yell.

26
00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:31.336
"I got rid of Police Headquarters!

27
00:01:32.572 --> 00:01:34.194
I got rid of Mayor Bloom!

28
00:01:35.175 --> 00:01:37.697
And now I will get rid of—Aah!"

29
00:01:39.078 --> 00:01:41.440
With one kick Roxy knocked the robot over.

30
00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:43.882
It fell down with a loud crash.

31
00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:49.827
Skrunch! Roxy stomped the robot with both feet.

32
00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.269
The metal bent and twisted.

33
00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.251
Sparks flew everywhere.

34
00:01:55.251 --> 00:01:58.034
One last puff of blue mist rose from the robot's arm.

35
00:01:58.694 --> 00:02:00.256
The small cloud hung in the air.

36
00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:02.821
Roxy heard a hatch open.

37
00:02:04.362 --> 00:02:06.423
Dr. Odd crawled out and started to run.

38
00:02:11.406 --> 00:02:12.186
Dr. Odd!"

39
00:02:12.466 --> 00:02:13.147
Roxy yelled.

40
00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:15.428
"You forgot something!"

41
00:02:16.629 --> 00:02:17.850
Roxy took a deep breath.

42
00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:20.391
She blew with all her power.

43
00:02:21.211 --> 00:02:25.534
Whoo-ooo-oosh! The cloud of blue mist raced after Dr.

44
00:02:25.634 --> 00:02:29.908
Odd until—bloop!

45
00:02:29.928 --> 00:02:30.248
"Argh!" Dr.

46
00:02:30.268 --> 00:02:31.629
Odd yelled from inside the bubble.

47
00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.012
Roxy ripped off the robot's hand and smiled.

48
00:02:35.032 --> 00:02:36.993
"You wait here, Dr.

49
00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:38.054
Odd," she said.

50
00:02:38.074 --> 00:02:40.215
"I'm going to pop some bubbles."

51
00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:48.981
Jack, Terrell, and Mara were sitting in the empty parking lot.

52
00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:52.603
"I wish we had some customers," said Jack.

53
00:02:52.623 --> 00:02:57.146
"I wonder what's taking Roxy so long," said Terrell.

54
00:02:58.387 --> 00:02:59.388
Mara heard something.

55
00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:04.711
"Look!" A long line of cars pulled into the parking lot.

56
00:03:05.972 --> 00:03:08.374
They were all covered in blue sticky goo.

57
00:03:08.394 --> 00:03:11.095
"We need our cars washed!"

58
00:03:11.476 --> 00:03:12.296
said one driver.

59
00:03:14.818 --> 00:03:16.099
The kids got right to work.

60
00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.381
A moment later Roxy returned.

61
00:03:19.401 --> 00:03:23.264
"Thanks for putting up more signs, Roxy!"

62
00:03:23.564 --> 00:03:24.144
said Jack.

63
00:03:25.245 --> 00:03:26.606
"Yeah," said Terrell.

64
00:03:26.626 --> 00:03:29.468
"Where did you get the signs anyway?"

65
00:03:30.845 --> 00:03:31.847
Roxy didn't answer.

66
00:03:35.999 --> 00:03:38.787
She just squeezed out a sponge and started washing cars.
